<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 12</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 12. DISCHARGE, TRANSFER AND CARE HANDOVER</b><div>Record the end of a care episode, or a transfer to another provider or caregiver, and hand over the information needed for safe continuing care. Completed by the sending clinician.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Care episode from</span><span class="v">{{ v.care_episode_from or prefill.care_episode_from }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">To</span><span class="v">{{ v.to or prefill.to }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Reason for ending / transfer</span><span class="v">{{ v.reason_for_ending_transfer or prefill.reason_for_ending_transfer }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Receiving provider or caregiver</span><span class="v">{{ v.receiving_provider_or_caregiver or prefill.receiving_provider_or_caregiver }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.contact or prefill.contact }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Summary of condition, care provided and progress against goals</span><span class="v">{{ v.summary_of_condition_care_provided_and_p or prefill.summary_of_condition_care_provided_and_p }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Outstanding problems and current care needs</span><span class="v">{{ v.outstanding_problems_and_current_care_ne or prefill.outstanding_problems_and_current_care_ne }}</span></div><h3>Medicines and continuing treatment</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Current verified medication list / order attached:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.current_verified_medication_list_order_a == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.current_verified_medication_list_order_a == "Not applicable" else "☐" }} Not applicable</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Reference / date</span><span class="v">{{ v.reference_date or prefill.reference_date }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Allergies / reactions</span><span class="v">{{ v.allergies_reactions or prefill.allergies_reactions }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Changes, last doses, next doses due and responsibility for administration</span><span class="v">{{ v.changes_last_doses_next_doses_due_and_re or prefill.changes_last_doses_next_doses_due_and_re }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Ongoing wound / device care, equipment and supplies</span><span class="v">{{ v.ongoing_wound_device_care_equipment_and_ or prefill.ongoing_wound_device_care_equipment_and_ }}</span></div><h3>Follow-up and safety</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Review appointment</span><span class="v">{{ v.review_appointment or prefill.review_appointment }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Provider / contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.provider_contact or prefill.provider_contact }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Pending results / actions and named responsible person</span><span class="v">{{ v.pending_results_actions_and_named_respon or prefill.pending_results_actions_and_named_respon }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Warning signs, emergency action and contact arrangements explained</span><span class="v">{{ v.warning_signs_emergency_action_and_conta or prefill.warning_signs_emergency_action_and_conta }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Patient / caregiver understanding and ability to continue care checked</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_caregiver_understanding_and_abil or prefill.patient_caregiver_understanding_and_abil }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Documents / care summary supplied</span><span class="v">{{ v.documents_care_summary_supplied or prefill.documents_care_summary_supplied }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Equipment / property returned or transferred</span><span class="v">{{ v.equipment_property_returned_or_transferr or prefill.equipment_property_returned_or_transferr }}</span></div><h3>Handover confirmation</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Receiving person name and role</span><span class="v">{{ v.receiving_person_name_and_role or prefill.receiving_person_name_and_role }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Receiving person</b></td><td>{{ sig.receiver.name }}<div class="m">Name and role</div><div>{{ sig.receiver.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.receiver.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.receiver.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.receiver.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br></td><td>{% if sig.receiver.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.receiver.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.receiver.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.receiver.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Patient or authorised representative</b><div class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.esign else "☐" }} I agree to sign electronically</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.name or patient.name }}<div class="m">Name, capacity / role</div><div>{{ sig.client.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.client.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.client.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.client.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.at }}</td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Copy supplied to patient / authorised recipient on</span><span class="v">{{ v.copy_supplied_to_patient_authorised_reci or prefill.copy_supplied_to_patient_authorised_reci }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="n">Necessary clinical information must not be withheld because fees are disputed. Handover acknowledgment records receipt of information, not a waiver of rights.</div><h3>Document control</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Form pack version</span><span class="v">{{ v.form_pack_version or prefill.form_pack_version }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Effective from</span><span class="v">{{ v.effective_from or prefill.effective_from }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Next review due</span><span class="v">{{ v.next_review_due or prefill.next_review_due }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Approved by (BLOOMWELL clinical lead)</span><span class="v">{{ v.approved_by_bloomwell_clinical_lead or prefill.approved_by_bloomwell_clinical_lead }}</span></td></tr></table></body></html>